Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[guinea fowls cackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the AgBot's Presbyterian work ethic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而农业机器人 跟清教徒似的工作态度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}meant farming was going on day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意味着农活正日夜不停地干着
