Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还窝在被窝里 不想干活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它还在干
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music continues]
