Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以 那是你的办公室 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah. -Still very much in the farming world.
