Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在这是一个 非常先进的科技化农场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it needed an office to reflect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它需要一个与之匹配的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here it is. Mission Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这儿 任务控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天哪
