Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}旧谷仓 清空了… 我基本上是把丽莎赶出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause she was using it as a storage for the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-因为她之前把它用作… -对 用作…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}商店的仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cold winter's evenings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}寒冷的冬夜 我们点起火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we light a fire and we sit there, on the two-pound,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐在那两英镑买来的三件套沙发上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}three-piece suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吗？这儿是开重要商务会议用的
