Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 -“82”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}82 millimetres. Now, I don't know whether that's good or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“82毫米” 我不知道这是好是坏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then just drop down here. So you just move...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后往下拉到这里 你移动一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Front camera, full screen. There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前摄像头 全屏 出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:14.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's live TV coming from the front of the AgBot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是农业机器人前面传来的实时画面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-How cool is that! -[Kaleb] Flip it to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这多酷？ -切到后面看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Look, there goes the red kites, dive-bombing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 那些红鸢在俯冲攻击它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're loving it 'cause there's no farmer in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很喜欢这样 因为没有农民在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I normally open the door, beep the horn to scare 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我平时会打开门 按喇叭把它们吓跑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, the other thing is, each pixel is two centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 每个像素对应两厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's phenomenally detailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以清晰度非常高
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And while I was buggering about the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天 我瞎捣鼓的时候 注意到一件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}something I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那儿 -那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That we have had a visitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人来光顾过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] From a fly-tipper. -From a fucking fly-tipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-有人偷倒垃圾 -他妈的有人偷倒垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Who would chuck a f... What is it, a fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-谁会扔…那是什么？冰箱？ -不知道 是个白色物品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Dunno. It's a white good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, who would put that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁会把那东西扔那儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out of all the places where you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么多地方你不扔…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we've gotta go get that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得去把那东西弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Do you wanna go now? -And since...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-想现在去？ -而且既然…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hello, you two. -[Kaleb] Hello, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们俩好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hey, Gerald!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你好！欢迎 -嘿 杰拉德！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Welcome to Mission Control. -[Gerald chuckling] Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎来到任务控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it grand to coordinate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一块地卡在里头了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-There it is going along. -[Gerald] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它正往前走呢 -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but these things will never take over man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the other hand, I'd jump straight out the bath
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and go out with no clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're not sold on this, Gerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你还是不买账 杰拉德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, nobody ever knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意儿到底在干什么 谁也说不清
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't remember what year it was, but the only story with that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我记不清是哪年了 但当时的情况就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他过来 一直在同一块地上来回跑 然后跑到上面去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...and not go out in my garden planting seeds with no pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没光着屁股跑到我家花园里撒种子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 那… -为了整修 知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Gerald speaking indistinctly]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] After Gerald had dispensed his wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德传授完他的智慧之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we went off to do a bit of tidying up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们去做点清理工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I've got the AgBot, which can cultivate all by itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我有农业机器人可以自己耕种
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm free to do this kind of job,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就有空干这种活了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}clearing up the mess
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:06:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清理那些脏兮兮的渣滓留下的烂摊子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}left by filthy, filthy riff-raff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking fly-tippers, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些乱倒垃圾的家伙 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'd love to be in the mind of the people who thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真想钻进那些人的脑子里看看 他们是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"We need to get rid of this fridge, we'll lob it through this hedge."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们得把这冰箱扔了 就把它扔过这个树篱吧”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do they not realise how much annoyance and effort and expense
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们难道不知道清理那破玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is needed to clear the bloody thing up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有多烦人、多费劲、多花钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The AgBot had also created time for us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业机器人也给我们腾出了时间 去林子里干些活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to do some jobs in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[upbeat music]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And a big one was clearing up all the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一件大事就是清理风暴达拉格
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that had been blown over by Storm Darragh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}刮倒的所有树木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And because the green Lambo was off games with yet another technical fault,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那台绿色兰博基尼 又一次因为故障停工了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to fire up the GOAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只好发动那台“史上最佳”拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[gear clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, the jerky gear changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}顿挫的换挡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the complete lack of braking, it's like being back at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}刹车基本没有 感觉就像回到了家里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God, there's more than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 比我想象的还多 一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's one, two, three, four, five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}四、五、六
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}seven, eight, nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七、八、九
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there's ten from just where I'm standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就我站的这个地方就有十棵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] To deal with the problem, I'd hired a meaty winch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了解决这个问题 我租了一台大功率绞盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So this is like a... this is the anchor. -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以这个是…这是地锚 -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop. Lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停 放低
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] With the ground anchor lowered and the tree shackled...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放下地锚 把树绑好…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] This is gonna feel good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这感觉肯定很爽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Ready? -Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-准备好了吗？ -动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] ...we winched and dragged the first tree out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们把第一棵树拖出了树林
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tree crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Powerful Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}兰博基尼动力强劲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah! Onto the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 继续下一棵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The work was especially satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这活儿干得特别有成就感…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Because Kaleb and I were working as a team...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我和卡莱布在合作…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until we weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}直到我们不再合作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] There's one tree stuck between two, so it fell down between two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一棵树卡在两棵树中间了 就是倒下来的时候卡在了中间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we pull it, it's gonna probably lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们直接拉 很可能会卡死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, here's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我的计划是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get the winch round that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-把绞盘绕到那棵树那边… -嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] And attach it to the top. -That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-…然后固定到树梢上 -那样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, it will. -No, it will just pull the tree that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-行 -不行 那样只会把树往那个方向拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yes, that's what I want. -No, I don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那就是我想要的效果 -我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No, I do because then it levels... -I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我想 因为它会平… -我不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, please be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 请你安静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but, no, hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你听我说完 绕过这棵 这样绕过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come round this one, around like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}back round right at the beginning of the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再绕回到…树干的最开头那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 -明白吗？你一拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As you pull, it should technically pull the tree like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按理说它应该会这样拉树
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we stop when we get to here, use that tree there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们拉到这儿就停下 用那边那棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-My way's easier. -No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我的方法更简单 -并不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] As we were arguing, the voice of reason arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挺简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们正吵着 理性的声音到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] How are you? -[Charlie] How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Quickly, Charlie, do you think this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快 查理 你觉得这能行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-What? -The logic of his thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么？ -他这想法的逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't know what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我不… -我不知道他在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-We're gonna pull this around to there. -The light end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们要把这棵树拉到那边去 -轻的那头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Very close to it. -[Charlie] Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对吧？ -非常靠近它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -好 现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It won't work 'cause it's gonna get jammed on that tree and that tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样行不通 因为 它会卡在那几棵树上 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't you just cut it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们为什么不直接把它锯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nah, chainsaws are for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 电锯是给弱者用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-What? -Well, we've got the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么？ -我们有动力 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Chainsaws are for the weak? -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-电锯是给弱者用的？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just stand out the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还是站远点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] It won't work! -[Jeremy] It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-行不通的 -行得通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] It won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] OK, we're gonna do it and then if it doesn't work, I've failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我们就这么干 如果不行 就算我失败
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy panting] -[Kaleb] Give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给我点力量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Ready? -[Jeremy] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-准备好了吗？ -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] That's going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是我弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它他妈的在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, why is it doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 它为什么这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I dunno. Press the stop button.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 按停止键
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-卡莱布？ -现在按“下降”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Press "down" now. Just press "down" once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就按一下“下降”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-What? -[Charlie] Press "down" once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么？ -就按一下“下降”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Just press "down".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就按“下降”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy and Charlie] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不行 -不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Oh, for fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] After Kaleb had manually lowered the anchor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等卡莱布手动把地锚降下来之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}废物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] ... I initiated my tree-hauling plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我开始实施我的拖树计划
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It's gonna pivot round exactly as I planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会像我计划的那样转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}exactly as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全像我计划的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好！你看 -他会很高兴的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] He's gonna be happy with that, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's got to turn up now and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他现在必须过来说 “干得好 杰里米 你的计划成了”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well done, Jeremy, your plan worked."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slack it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}松开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nothing. So far, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-没动静 到现在还没动静 -松开了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's not going to admit that my plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他不会承认我的计划成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[scoffing]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I know it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我知道成功了 我就是知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm going to go sleep tonight going: "My plan worked."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我今晚睡觉的时候都会想 “我的计划成功了”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I'm not gonna live this down for a long time, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我这辈子都翻不了篇了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Sadly, there was no time to enjoy being right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可惜 没时间享受 “我赢了”的喜悦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Lisa summoned me back to the farmyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为丽莎叫我回农场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She said there was a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说出问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太安静了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Can you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能听到什么声音吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You can't hear... They're not in here, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你听不到…它们不在这里面 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] I don't know. I'm gonna go back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 我到后面去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Guinea fowl feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珍珠鸡的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Oh flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, and another one. Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又一只 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a fox, isn't it? Just killing for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是狐狸干的 对吧？就是杀着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] How am I going to explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我该怎么解释呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Granddaughter coming for the weekend: "Can I go and see the guinea fowl?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}孙女周末要来 “我能去看看珍珠鸡吗？”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Do we have any neighbours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有没有邻居？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We can indoctrinate her from an early age to not be trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好在我们可以 从她小时候就开始给她洗脑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into that London way of thinking that foxes are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让她不要被伦敦那种 “狐狸很可爱”的想法给骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, I saw a fox in Wandsworth and he was so sweet."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我在旺兹沃思看到一只狐狸 它好可爱啊”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, he wasn't. He's a murdering bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 它不可爱 它是个杀鸡犯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Jeremy! -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-杰里米！ -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good news. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好消息 那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, one of them... -[Lisa] One of them survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-有一只… -有一只活下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy softly] Oh, thank fuck for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-谢天谢地 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can stay up there, it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以待在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Poor thing, seeing its brothers and sisters being massacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安全了 可怜的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}眼睁睁看着自己的兄弟姐妹被杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Fortunately, later that day, there was just the job to cheer us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 那天晚些时候 刚好有件事让我们心情好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are any of them "bagging up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有哪头开始涨奶了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I think there's a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得有几头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] With the cows about to give birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}奶牛快生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we needed to turn the barn into a maternity ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要把谷仓改造成产房
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So Lizzie the goat farmer was coming along
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 养山羊的莉齐要来帮我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to help us move these horned lawnmowers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把这些长角的割草机赶到田里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}out into the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Afternoon, all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下午好 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Lizzie! -[Lisa] Hi, Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-莉齐！ -嗨 莉齐！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-How are you? -[Lizzie] What's occurring?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怎么样？ -你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moving 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要赶它们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The easiest way would be to use a trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最简单的方法是用拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but as it was such a lovely Spring afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这么好的春天下午
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to go old school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定用老方法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're going into a field called Hollowback which is not very far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们要去的那块地 叫霍洛贝克 离得不远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we should be able to walk 'em down. Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们应该能把它们赶过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Sorry, what did you just say there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉 你刚才说什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Walk them down. It's just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赶过去 就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] What could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能出什么岔子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Nothing! Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会出岔子的！说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, here's what we're gonna do, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我们这么办 行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna move you into a field called Hollowback,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要把你们赶到 一块叫霍洛贝克的田里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is full of lovely, tasty, juicy grass
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里长满了好吃又多汁的草
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you'll be very happy in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们在那儿会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you are gonna be the leader, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你来当领头的 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wonder what the goat's thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我好奇这头山羊在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] He's thinking: "What is that muppet saying to me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在想：“那个傻瓜在跟我说什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[goats bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Who said we needed a trailer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁说我们需要拖拉机来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Oi! What are you doing? Go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在干什么？往那边走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] No, oi, none of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你们都不听话 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Goats, goats, goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}山羊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, no, that way! Can we not climb up there, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行了 不 往那边走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-能不能别往那儿爬？ -山羊！快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of you, stop this! Stop this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们全都停下 别胡闹了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lizzie] No, no, no. -Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 -继续走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] This is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}进展不错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, for fuck's sake. -[Lizzie] Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-该死 -山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lizzie] Come on! -[Kaleb] Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-快点 -下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都怪你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi. Listen to this. Tasty snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 听着 好吃的零食
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think what's happening here is they're dining on steak
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得现在的情况是 它们在吃牛排
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I'm offering them kale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我却在给它们羽衣甘蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Once they'd finished their buffet, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 等它们吃完自助餐之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on, off you get, go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走 下去 走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] ...we got them headed in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们让它们朝着正确的方向走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. Come on, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快来 你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're in charge. I put you in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你负责带队 我让你负责 -继续走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Keep going! Keep going! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Oh look, now the sheep want to run too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:54.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 现在羊也想跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hello, sheeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-快走！ -你们好 羊们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] That's quite a picture now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这画面挺有意思的 对吧？ -是不是很美！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Isn't that gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love the fact that he's got his AgBot and then he's moving goats like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他既有他的农业机器人 又像这样赶山羊 我太喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come on, goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来啊 山羊们！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie whizzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-走！ -快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上去 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi, go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续走！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I mean, look at that sight, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这景象 拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On a night like tonight, farming is the best job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像今晚这样的夜晚 务农就是世界上最好的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Why did I waste my life driving round corners shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我为什么要浪费生命 在赛道上拐着弯狂吼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't have been able to afford to do this, that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为不那样 我根本没钱干这个 就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Come on, boys! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快走 小伙子们！快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] After the most delightful journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经过这段最愉快的旅程 我们把山羊赶到了它们的新田地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got the goats to their new field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] That's done! -[Jeremy] They all in then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-搞定了 -它们都进去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我觉得都进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这么简单！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好吧… -那简直是件艺术品！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lizzie] A work of art that was!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That was heavenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The rural "Lord Sugar", however,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 这位乡下“舒格勋爵”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}thought the whole thing was a bit of an indulgence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}觉得整件事有点太浪费时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I thought we were gonna cut down the animals on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为我们要精简农场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-We are cutting the animals. -[Kaleb] To try and streamline the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-减少牲畜数量 -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] We are. -[Kaleb] How are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Pigs. -Yeah, OK, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-猪？ -嗯 好的 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Sheeps, eventually. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-羊 最终也会 -对 那这些呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And what about these? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Why? -Mainly the film crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-主要是因为摄制组 -什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you actually want 'em here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们真的想让它们在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[man] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们投票吧 摄制组
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We'll have a vote. Film crew, who wants the goats to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-谁想让山羊留下来？ -我们想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[crew member] They're part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们也是团队的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"They're part of the crew"... -No, they absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“他们也是团队的一员” -不 他们非常喜欢这些山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-love the goats. -[Kaleb] Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看这两位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's like a Cadbury's Flake advert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嘿 -那就像吉百利巧克力片的广告一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有人记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They just used to get
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以前广告里总是 让一些特别漂亮的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}very, very good-looking girls
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to wander through a poppy field or a wheat field
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}穿着蕾丝裙 在罂粟田或麦田里漫步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in lacy dresses eating a Cadbury's Flake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃着吉百利巧克力片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of whom, I think, married Roger Taylor, the drummer in Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一个女孩 我想是嫁给了 皇后乐队的鼓手罗杰泰勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have no idea what you're on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我完全不知道你在说什么 -你难道不…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you not... [sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I don't know what he goes on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道他在说什么 有时候我就…我现在就只是点头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sometimes I just... I just nod now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The following morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I started the day by checking in on our one remaining guinea fowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我先去查看了我们仅存的那只珍珠鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, guinea fowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 珍珠鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck's sake, this is just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 这真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}beyond belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's just bitten its head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狐狸直接把它的头咬掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It hasn't even eaten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至都没吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[grunting softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's had the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它把它们全杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There was, though, only time to seethe, not mourn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我只有时间愤怒 没有时间悲伤…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because today was a big day on the AgBot front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为今天是农业机器人 进展中的大日子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It had finished cultivating all the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它已经耕完了所有的田地 现在将要执行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and would now be charged with the most important job of them all:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有任务中最重要的一项…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}planting the seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}播种
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There it is. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have begun. We are drilling the lager
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们开始了 我们正在播种大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we're drilling it into well-prepared,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且是在准备充分 施肥到位、时间刚好的地里播种
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}well-fertilised fields on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Once we'd finished hooking up the drill...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把播种机挂好之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That side-- This side's lined up. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边对齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] ...the AgBot eagerly set off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…农业机器人就立刻出发了 而那个反科技的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the Luddite, as ever, full of praise for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一如既往地对它“赞不绝口”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Look, it's not drilling now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它现在没在播种 没在播种
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not drilling, not drilling, not drilling, not drilling, not drilling, not drilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's all a miss. -No... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-全漏了 -不…对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is all a miss. Just there is missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-全漏了 就那儿漏了 -等它准备好了就会开始播种的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It comes on when it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, that's all missed. Just here will not grow anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 全漏了 这儿什么都不会长出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. It starts blowing it out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 等它准备好了就会开始播种的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-when it's ready. -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好 -它会放下那个东西 打开风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It will lower the thing, turn the fan on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then start when it wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后等它想开始的时候再开始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That is gonna be a miss. -Well, and it's not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那会漏掉的 那是播种漏掉了 -它不应该漏的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It is! -It'll come back over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它会回来重新播种的！ -不会的 我保证它不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[voices fading out]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[folk music]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Despite Kaleb's relentless negativity,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管卡莱布不停地泼冷水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}my machine set about this new task with its usual precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的机器还是以它一贯的精准 开始了这项新任务
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And there he goes, inch perfect again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它出发了 又一次精准无误
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There was one drawback with the AgBot, though:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 农业机器人有一个缺点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's not allowed on the public highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不能上公路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So when it needed to get from one field to another across a road,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 当它需要穿过一条路 从一块地到另一块地时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I suspected life would be a massive faff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我担心会非常麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna do Arlo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去阿洛那块地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you gonna get down there then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你打算怎么下去？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ah. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要把播种机卸下来 挂到兰博基尼上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna take the drill off,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}attach it to the Lambo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}drive the Lambo down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开着兰博基尼下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}drop the drill off in the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把播种机卸在地里 把兰博基尼开回院子里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bring the Lambo back to the yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:20:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挂上拖拉机 把农业机器人装上拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}attach it to the trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}put the AgBot on the trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}drive that down to Arlo's,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开着拖拉机下到阿洛那块地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}take the AgBot off the trailer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把农业机器人卸下拖拉机 再重新挂上播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and reattach it to the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By the time you've done all of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等你做完这些 我都能 把农场的播种活干完了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I could have completed the whole farm drilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yes, I know. -As well as another 30 other farms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-可能还能干完另外30个农场的活 -对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Kaleb had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My plan would be incredibly time-consuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的计划会非常耗时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as we're on TV, I couldn't just ignore the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我们在拍节目 我不能无视法律
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I came up with a rather clever solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我想出了 一个相当聪明的解决办法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Watch this. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看好了 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With this simple black cloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用这块简单的黑布…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine revving]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗒哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there we are, just this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 我们到了 只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know where these tyre marks have come from. It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道这些轮胎印 是哪儿来的 真是个谜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:00.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there we are. Onwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 就这样吧 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Back in the world of animal farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到养殖业的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}things were starting to happen in the cow barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}牛棚里开始有动静了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With one of the Moocall alarms alerting me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}莫考尔警报器通知我 有头小牛要出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that a calf was on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经出来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa? It's out! It's here! We have a calf!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎 出来了 它在这儿呢 我们有小牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 那太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I get a call from the Moocall saying: "Birth imminent."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的意思是 我接到莫考尔的电话说 “即将分娩”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It doesn't say: "Birth has happened."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它没说：“已经生了”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Endgame's first child!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终局的第一个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she's eating the placenta and doing everything properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它正在吃胎盘 一切都很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is just so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's a very handsome face. -[Lisa] Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那张脸真好看 -漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love the way that it affects the others, look. They're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢它对其他牛的影响 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, they're all coming for a look! That's rather sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 它们都围过来看了 挺温馨的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] The first calf had been born at a civilised hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一头小牛是 在一个正常的时间出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next one, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二头就不一样了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[light switch clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[light switch clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cow mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moocall went off at 3:15.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}莫考尔是3点15响的 现在已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}ten to five.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}4点50了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还没动静
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome to the world of the beef farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎来到肉牛养殖的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure there's a whole lot I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不确定我能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to start the pushing at this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到这个阶段 你得开始用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, she doesn't know where she wants to be, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不知道它想待在哪里 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't know whether you want to be standing up or lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你也不知道你是想站着还是躺着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看到一只脚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:23:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, she has given birth so far to a balloon and a hoof.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:23:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 到目前为止 它只生出来一个水泡和一只蹄子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Come on. -[cow panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Definitely two feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确实是两只脚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And back in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又缩回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.08,0:23:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's the dawn chorus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清晨的鸟叫声响起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Eventually, a mere two hours and forty-five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终于 在莫考尔响铃仅仅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}after the Moocall had gone off...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2小时45分钟后…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cow mooing and snorting]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The alien is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“外星人”要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, come on, big push.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 使劲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Big push. There's a nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}使劲 看到鼻子了…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[mooing loudly] -Oh, an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}眼睛！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, and a whole head!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整个头都出来了 头
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A head!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}耳朵 脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:23:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, push, push, push. Back, just the hips.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 用力 回来 就差屁股了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 用力
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.12,0:24:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.12,0:24:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you've gotta breathe. You've gotta breathe, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 你得呼吸 亲爱的 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get some straw in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}弄点稻草进去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, let's have some breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 让它呼吸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.88,0:24:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[mooing] -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.88,0:24:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That looks like a great little calf!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来是头很棒的小牛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Already trying to walk, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经在试着走路了 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah! It's a joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是件开心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Missed a night's sleep, and yet, when you see that happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一夜没睡 但当你看到这一切的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.56,0:24:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.56,0:24:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就觉得值了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] After this completely perfect start to the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在这一天完美的开局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went over to see the Swiss Army Knife
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去看了看那把“瑞士军刀”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which now had a new attachment
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它现在有了一个新的附件…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and was using it to roll the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正在用它给地压实…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] ...where we would be growing onions and beetroots.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…我们将在那里种植洋葱和甜菜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.60,0:25:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And to plant those, we'd need another new machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.60,0:25:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而要种植那些 我们还需要另一台新机器
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, I'm gonna blow your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.96,0:25:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我要用播种机器人 让你大吃一惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the FarmDroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.16,0:25:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] This was the other bit of kit
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.16,0:25:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一月份在LAMMA展会上
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that had caught my eye at the LAMMA exhibition back in January.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吸引我注意力的另一套设备
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（播种机器人）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.44,0:25:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A solar-powered onion planter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.44,0:25:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一台太阳能驱动的洋葱播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] What, it's another robot? -Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么 又一个机器人？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.80,0:25:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I thought it actually goes on the back of the AgBot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.80,0:25:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我原以为它会挂在农业机器人的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! This now trundles along.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 现在它自己慢悠悠地走 我们把种子装进去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We fill it with seed and he plants all the onions for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就会为我们种下所有的洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is completely electric and that's a solar panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这完全是电动的 那是一块太阳能电池板
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.84,0:25:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] What happens if the sun went in?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.84,0:25:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果太阳下山了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.32,0:26:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, it's got batteries so it stores some of the electrical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.32,0:26:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有电池 所以可以储存一些电能
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an electric...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这是电动的？那是电动的？ -太阳能就是这么工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.56,0:26:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's how solar panels work. -Is that electric?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know why I thought that was an electric fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道我为什么会以为那是电围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It does look it, doesn't it? No, if you touch that it'll stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来像 对吧？ 如果你碰一下那个 它会停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.28,0:26:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Razmus, the man who'd first shown me the FarmDroid,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.28,0:26:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拉斯穆斯 即最初 给我看播种机器人的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then came over to explain how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走过来解释它的工作原理
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's all by GPS, yeah? So it remembers exactly where it plants each onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全靠全球定位系统 好吗？ 所以它能准确记住每颗洋葱种在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So this is the field, let's just say. -Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以 比如说这是那块地 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And it puts an onion in here. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它在这里种一颗洋葱 -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.24,0:26:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 间距多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We put it in to 15 centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我们设成15厘米 -好的 15厘米 然后它会记住？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK, 15 centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And then it remembers? -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And then places it every 15 centimetres? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-然后每隔15厘米种一颗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.44,0:26:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So it's extremely precise? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.44,0:26:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以非常精确？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So how many onions is it going to plant in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.00,0:26:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那这块地里要种多少颗洋葱？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}600,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-六十万颗 -六十万颗洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-600,000 onions. -Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] How fast does it go? -Maximum 1K.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它跑多快？ -最快每小时一公里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, yeah. -[Jeremy] About the same speed as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 -大概和我一样快
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hold on. If it only does one kilometre an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 如果它每小时只跑一公里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.64,0:26:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and you've got a hare and a tortoise... -[Razmus] But that's only...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.64,0:26:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那在“龟兔赛跑”里 这一公里是兔子还是乌龟？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.48,0:26:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Is the one kilometre the hare or the tortoise?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Razmus] That's the hare!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那是兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.00,0:26:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[all laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:27:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is a slow-driving machine so it would drive into the night tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:27:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一台跑得很慢的机器 所以今晚要干到半夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then after we done the seeding, we convert this machine into weeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我们播完种之后 把这台机器转换成除草机
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which means that this machine is also doing the weeding part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也就是说 这台机器 也负责除草的部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, so it just digs up the weeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是把杂草挖出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah, just killing the smaller weeds. -And leaves the onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 只挖小杂草 -不会影响洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Does it have cameras on it? -[Razmus] Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它上面有摄像头吗？ -有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.68,0:27:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just give you access to the app to this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.68,0:27:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会给你开这个机器的应用程序权限 这样你在家就可以查看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then you can just sit home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh man! I've got the AgBot cameras and this cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊！我既有农业机器人的摄像头 又有这个的摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Razmus] Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -这就是丽莎前几天说的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.04,0:27:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is what Lisa said the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was sitting looking at the cameras from it and she went:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在看农业机器人的 摄像头画面时 她说
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.60,0:27:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Why can't you watch Pornhub like a normal man
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.60,0:27:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你就不能像个正常男人一样 去看黄色网站吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}instead of sitting watching your AgBot going up and down!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非要坐在这儿 看你的农业机器人上上下下？”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh Christ, I'm gonna have both of them! I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 我两个都要 我等不及了 我们能让它动起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Can we get it going? -Yeah, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Once we'd filled the hoppers with onion seeds...
