Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.40,0:38:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] It's hard work! -[Lisa panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-真累人！ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] To clear up some more storm damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…去清理一些风暴留下的损坏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's so silent. -It's been years and years,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-真安静啊 -过去几年
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}every time you come down here, they all come
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次你来这儿 它们都会跑过来看你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-running along to see you and now look. -I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-现在你看 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.88,0:39:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mind you, that being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.88,0:39:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 话虽这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.52,0:39:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's not completely empty now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.52,0:39:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在也不是完全空荡荡的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.92,0:39:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.92,0:39:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为看谁来了 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.96,0:39:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.96,0:39:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Richard Ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.96,0:39:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德汉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.28,0:39:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look how he has grown!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.28,0:39:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看它长得多大！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.40,0:39:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-He has become a mighty pig! -[Lisa] Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.40,0:39:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它变成了一头大猪！ -对！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.56,0:39:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] A huge pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.56,0:39:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-一头巨大的猪！ -它好大
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Richard Ham! Come and say hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德汉姆！过来打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I should just explain what's going on here. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我应该解释一下这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-We've kept him. We had to. -Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把它留下来了 我们不得不留
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.08,0:39:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.40,0:39:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem we've got, though, is he can't be a fluffer anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.40,0:39:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们遇到的问题是 它不能再当种猪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause there's no more pigs to fluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为没有更多的猪需要它配种了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, you can't eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不能吃他 因为我们下不去手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.64,0:39:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause we just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.44,0:39:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we can't breed from him
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.44,0:39:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且也不能用它来繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because there's something genetically wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他基因有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.84,0:39:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've just got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们只能养着它
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.08,0:40:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you can't keep a pig on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.08,0:40:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你不能只养一头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.72,0:40:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, over there we've got another pig,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.72,0:40:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 在那边 我们还有另一头猪 另一头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}another boy pig, and then he can have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样他就能有个伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What'll you call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算叫它什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-What, the friend? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么 那头作伴的？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.84,0:40:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, who is Richard Hammond's best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.84,0:40:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德汉姆最好的朋友是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not calling it James May. I'm not having a pig called James May.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可不会叫他詹姆斯梅 我可不要一头叫詹姆斯梅的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.04,0:40:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Boar. Let's call him James Boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.04,0:40:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}公猪 我们叫他公詹姆斯吧 这…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.00,0:40:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[both laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.76,0:40:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-He is a boar! -[Lisa] He is a boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.76,0:40:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是一头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] He is literally a boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它是一头公猪 -它确确实实是一头公猪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.40,0:40:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing] Richard Ham and James Boar!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.40,0:40:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德汉姆和公詹姆斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.84,0:40:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What had been an extremely pleasant day ended well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.84,0:40:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}原本非常愉快的一天 也以美好的方式结束了…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.96,0:40:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because as the sun set,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.96,0:40:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为日落时分
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.28,0:40:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and I made a thermos of Bovril,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.28,0:40:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎和我泡了一保温杯的牛肉汤 开车到田里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.48,0:40:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}drove out to the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and settled down for our new favourite date night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安顿下来 开始了 我们最喜欢的约会之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.60,0:40:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clicks]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, look, he's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它停了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's having a think about how to turn round.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在想怎么掉头
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.04,0:41:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's turning round.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.04,0:41:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在掉头了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.68,0:41:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[softly] Oh my God, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.68,0:41:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉自己像是十八世纪的人在看着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] I do feel like I'm from the 18th century
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}looking at tractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-刚出现的拖拉机 -进取号星舰刚刚降落在了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.16,0:41:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the Starship Enterprise has just landed at Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.16,0:41:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-迪丽斯库阿特 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] It's very soporific, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.04,0:41:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常催眠 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.36,0:41:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[machine whirring]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.60,0:41:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sure there is something good on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.60,0:41:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我相信电视上肯定有什么好节目…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.68,0:41:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But nothing is as good as watching
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.68,0:41:37.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但没有什么 比看着农业经历革命更棒的了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.60,0:41:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}farming being revolutionised
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.16,0:41:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and just know that when you get up in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.16,0:41:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且只要想想 等你早上起床
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}these two will be sitting drumming their fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这两个家伙就会坐在那儿 手指敲着桌面等着…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我知道 -…说：“好了 那活儿干完了”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.56,0:41:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Going: "OK, we've done that job."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.36,0:41:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] And I do feel like we need to give them jobs. They're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.36,0:41:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实觉得我们应该 给它们安排工作 它们很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.08,0:41:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you think they talk to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.08,0:41:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你觉得它们会互相说话吗？ -不会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy chuckling] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们肯定会的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.12,0:41:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Well, they must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.36,0:41:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft country music]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.96,0:42:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] A few days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.96,0:42:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 所有的小牛都出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.52,0:42:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all of the calves had been born
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the maternity ward was a joy to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}产房里一片喜气洋洋的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.08,0:42:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, look, he's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.08,0:42:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它跑起来了！ 你看它！看它多开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.60,0:42:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.12,0:42:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look how happy he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.40,0:42:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.40,0:42:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}轮到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.84,0:42:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.84,0:42:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this little calf!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看这头小牛！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.88,0:42:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I love watching that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.88,0:42:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢看这场景！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.76,0:42:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Look at them bounce around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.76,0:42:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看它们蹦蹦跳跳的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.24,0:42:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] They are adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.24,0:42:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.56,0:42:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] They've got space!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.56,0:42:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们有空间了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.40,0:42:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I've decided now...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.40,0:42:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在决定了 你知道几周后我就65岁了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.12,0:42:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know I'm gonna be 65 in a couple of weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.72,0:42:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah. -Retirement age.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.72,0:42:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -所以 退休年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.44,0:42:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, historically always retirement age.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.44,0:42:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}历来都是退休年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna be a cow midwife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要当一名牛的助产士 不打高尔夫 不画水彩画
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.12,0:42:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No golf, no watercolour painting. Midwifery for cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.12,0:42:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给牛当助产士
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.08,0:42:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Bear in mind, you have seen, like, the good versions of it happening.
