Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.92,0:46:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.12,0:46:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[spitting]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.32,0:46:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.32,0:46:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.48,0:46:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] In the end, I decided not to move back to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.48,0:46:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后 我决定不回伦敦了…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the crops were in on time,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为庄稼按时种上了…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.48,0:46:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the calves were in good health,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.48,0:46:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小牛们都很健康…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.44,0:46:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the weather was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.44,0:46:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天气也完美
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.64,0:46:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, for the first time since I'd started farming all those years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.64,0:46:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 从我多年前开始务农以来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.92,0:46:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}life at Diddly Squat
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.92,0:46:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特的生活 首次像个美梦似的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.40,0:46:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was an absolute dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.76,0:47:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Sometimes the texture of what you're eating feels odd
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.76,0:47:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（下集预告）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but actually the taste is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有时候你吃的东西口感有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.68,0:47:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但味道很美味
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.00,0:47:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not loving that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.00,0:47:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不太喜欢那个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.04,0:47:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're building a leaky, woody dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.04,0:47:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在建一个漏水的木头堤坝 我们就像人类中的海狸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.44,0:47:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're like human beavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.48,0:47:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a magnificent beast, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.48,0:47:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正如你看到的 它是一头壮观的野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not the easiest thing to sell in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是最好卖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.72,0:47:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lot 12-46. £60,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.72,0:47:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第1246号拍品 六万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.60,0:47:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译：匡思颖
